oomol/oo-satismeter  1.0.0 -> 1.0.1
change_type: instructions+docs   changelog: - Uses OOMOL-connected SatisMeter credentials through the `oo` CLI, avoiding direct API token handling. - Provides read-only access to SatisMeter projects, surveys, survey statistics, and response data. - Supports listing surveys for a project and responses at both project and survey scope. - Instructs agents to inspect live connector schemas before running actions, keeping payloads aligned with the current API contract. - Documents first-time setup and recovery paths for missing CLI, auth, conn

